	/// Budget accumulated year-to-date: the marketing budget from the price calculation plus credit notes received; negative where the margin does not cover the four rates. Value; a Lookup view of Budget Accumulated Actual Year for the marketing tooltip.
	measure 'Budget Accumulated | Tooltip' =
			
